I check my information in the digital form.
My mobile number is already filled in there.
I read the number once again.
Ninety-eight, seventy-six, fifty-four, thirty-two, ten.
My mobile number is correct.
Then I check my flat number.
That number is four hundred and four.
That is also written correctly.
Now I fill some empty fields in the application.
I often experience technical glitches on government websites.
Usually, information is loaded very slowly there.
I always procrastinate for such tasks.
But tonight nothing like that is happening.
Today all the pages are opening very fast and smoothly.
I am a little surprised by this thing.
I type my remaining information in the form.
Finally, an official instruction is shown on the screen.
'Your information is being saved.'
I am now ready to submit the application.
